[Lecture1.pdf p.25] Compiling 
What happens when we compile? 
#include <stdio.h> 
int do_thing( float a, float b ) { 
/* do things */ 
} 
void call(void) { 
/* do stuff */ 
do_thing( a, b ); 
/* do more */ 
} 
int main(void) { 
call(); 
return 0; 
} 
Andre Kessler 
